  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 45 + 35 × 7 – 81 ÷ 9 = 321\n\nSo, by interchanging the number according to question :\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 45 and 35\n\n35 + 45 × 7 – **81 ÷ 9**__ = 321\n\n35 + __**45 × 7**__ – 9 = 321\n\n__**35 + 315**__ - 9 = 321\n\n__**350 - 9**__ = 321\n\n341 ≠ 321 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 45 and 7\n\n7 + 35 × 45 – 81 ÷ 9__ = 321\n\n7 + __**3**5 × 45__ – 9 = 321\n\n__7 + 1575__ - 9 = 321\n\n__1582 - 9__ = 321\n\n1573 ≠ 321 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 7 and 9\n\n45 + 35 × 9 – 81 ÷ 7__ = 321\n\n45 + __35 × 9__ – 11.57 = 321\n\n__45 + 315__ - 11.57 = 321\n\n__360 - 11.57__ = 321\n\n348.43 ≠ 321 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 45 and 81\n\n81 + 35 × 7 – **45** ÷ 9__ = 321\n\n81 + __35 × 7__ – 5 = 321\n\n__81 + 245__ - 5 = 321\n\n__326 - 5__ = 321\n\n321 = 321 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, **\"****45**** and 81\"** is the correct answer.",
